    "valid_segment()/under_docs() in pigeonhole.lib.sh.",
    "What each key is for: doc_type and qualifier are shown to the classifier as",
    "values already in use, so the same vendor is spelled the same way across years —",
    "the model may still coin a new one. owner is a real enum in the schema (four",
    "people plus unknown; genuinely closed). _lookalike_families routes notifications.",
